          </paramlist><![CDATA[Profile:
1.  Flatstart
2.  LVRT
3.  HVRT
4.  V-down
5.  V-up
6.  LVRT Dips (ieee2800, NOGRR245)
7.  HVRT (ieee2800, NOGRR245)
8.  Angle down
9.  Angle up
10.  Custom fault(s)

The 2800 LVRT test (profile 6) has two profiles, WGR and PVGR, depending on the Wind or Solar / Energy Storage flag on the main PMView block.]]></Sticky>
