        <Sticky classid="Sticky" x="0" y="0" w="414" h="216" id="580997137">
          <paramlist>
            <param name="font" value="1" />
            <param name="align" value="0" />
            <param name="style" value="1" />
            <param name="arrows" value="0" />
            <param name="fg_color" value="0" />
            <param name="bg_color" value="15792890" />
            <param name="full_font" value="Tahoma, 9pt" />
            <param name="opacity" value="25" />
            <param name="fg_color_adv" value="#FF000000" />
            <param name="bg_color_adv" value="#FFFAFAF0" />
            <param name="hl_color_adv" value="#FFFFFF00" />
            <param name="bdr_color_adv" value="#FF95918C" />
          </paramlist><![CDATA[PMView - Version 2.3 - August 13, 2024

Jonathan Rose and Yunzhi Cheng
Jonathan.Rose@ercot.com, yunzhi.cheng@ercot.com

https://sites.google.com/view/pmview

To understand the different Test Profiles, look inside the sub-blocks or watch the website videos.
  -- Profiles 1~10:  V & Angle block
  -- Profiles 11~12: Frequency block
  -- Profile 13:  V up and Down block
  -- Profile 14:  SCR block
  -- Profile 15:  DFR and PMU playback blocks]]></Sticky>
        <Sticky classid="Sticky" id="1888153665" x="432" y="0" w="342" h="288" colors="0, 15792890">
          <paramlist>
            <param name="full_font" value="Tahoma, 9pt" />
            <param name="align" value="0" />
            <param name="style" value="1" />
            <param name="font" value="1" />
            <param name="fg_color" value="0" />
            <param name="bg_color" value="8454016" />
            <param name="arrows" value="0" />
            <param name="opacity" value="25" />
            <param name="fg_color_adv" value="#FF000000" />
            <param name="bg_color_adv" value="#FF80FF80" />
            <param name="hl_color_adv" value="#FFFFFF00" />
            <param name="bdr_color_adv" value="#FF95918C" />
          </paramlist><![CDATA[TEST PROFILES:
____________________
1.  Flatstart
2.  LVRT (data file has ERCOT Legacy)
3.  HVRT (data file has ERCOT Legacy)
4.  V-down
5.  V-up
6.  LVRT Dips (ieee2800 / nogrr245 Preferred)
7.  HVRT Preferred (ieee2800)
8.  Angle down
9.  Angle up
10.  Custom fault(s)
11.  Frequency Down
12.  Frequency Up
13.  V up and down w/ impedance
14.  Short Ckt Ratio SCR
15.  PMU playback]]></Sticky>
